No game files
-------------

OpenAlienNations contains no files of the original game: no graphics, sounds, music, maps,
texts or programs. To play, you need your own original copy of Alien Nations / Die Völker
(for example the GOG version, or the CD / Gold Edition). The program reads the game files
from your own installation.

