HD interface pack (folder hd/) - NOT covered by the GPL
-------------------------------------------------------

The folder hd/ (and the copy of it built into the release downloads and the Docker image)
contains an "HD" version of the game's menus and interface panels. These images were made
by upscaling the interface artwork of the original game and its add-on. They are derived
from that artwork, so they are NOT covered by the GNU General Public License, and the
copyright of the original rights holders applies to them.

They are included only so that owners of the original game can use them together with
their own copy. They are optional: switch them off in the game under
Settings -> Graphics -> "HD-Grafik", or leave them out entirely by deleting the hd/ folder
(source checkout or own builds) or by starting the server with --hd pointing at an empty
folder.

